# Baseplate — Operator-Private Zone patterns (Convention 8; see CONTRIBUTING.md § Content zones)

# Operator profile — never tracked, never auto-inferred (P7 / ONF-4)
_USER.md

# Per-cartridge working state and session logs (operator's active work)
*/Sessions/
*/_design-state.md
*/_dependency-log.md

# Shipped Examples carve-out (Convention 8): Example-Product-* cartridges are
# release-owned reference implementations and ship IN FULL — re-include the
# working files the operator-private patterns above would otherwise ignore.
!Example-Product-*/Sessions/
!Example-Product-*/_design-state.md
!Example-Product-*/_dependency-log.md

# Filesystem / workspace noise
.DS_Store
.obsidian/

# NOTE: the Grows-Through-Use Zone (_portfolio/failure-catalog.md) is intentionally
# NOT ignored — it ships seeded and is merge-updated, not clobbered, on git pull.
